1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Your tires are trying to tell you
something - most drivers miss it.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Sign one: the penny test. See all of
Lincoln's head? Tread's under 2/32" - illegal.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Sign two: sidewall cracking. Ohio summers
bake rubber - cracks mean it can fail
with tread left.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Sign three: vibration that worsens with
speed. That's a belt separating inside
the tire.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Any one of these on a hot Cleveland
highway = roadside blowout, not a bill.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Nick's Tire & Auto in Euclid checks all
three free - no appointment, 10 minutes.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Link in bio. Get it checked
before it checks you.
